question:
Adjacent sides of a new figure (Figure 3) are perpendicular. Six sides of Figure 3 are removed to form Figure 4. What is the total length, in units, of the remaining segments in Figure 4?

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(5,0)--(5,9)--(4,9)--(4,4)--(1,4)--(1,10)--(0,10)--cycle);
draw((8,10)--(8,0)--(13,0)--(13,9)--(12,9));
label("Figure 3",(2.5,0),S);
label("Figure 4",(10.5,0),S);
label("10",(0,5),W);
label("3",(2.5,4),S);
label("9",(5,4.5),E);
label("1",(0.5,10),N);
label("1",(4.5,9),N);
[/asy]

